Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Years ago, I took a trip to Egypt,\Nwhere I met an old hag named Anjuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She told me to fire this\Narrow at whoever it desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the Impaled would become my ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the initial shock,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they would witness a unique power rising\Nup from the deep recesses of their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If memory serves, she\Nreferred to them as Stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he and his minion army of Hitman\Nare pursuing my dear Yoshikage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll have to create my own army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One like no other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An army of stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we are, Arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time's come to select your prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which of these vessels do you desire? Huh?
