Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A telephone pole?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.18,0:00:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you want a Dolphin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You desire that child?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me a child is to\Nbecome the first of my new allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.24,0:01:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is your will, I'll pierce the\Nlad's soul and add him to our ranks!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.61,0:01:31.77,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}taisetsu na mono ubawaresou
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.61,0:01:31.77,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}Something important is being taken from me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.77,0:01:34.19,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}nichijou ni magirekonda akuma
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.77,0:01:34.19,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}By a demon that's thrust itself into my life
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.19,0:01:37.57,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion nara tokkuni kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.19,0:01:37.57,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}Everything is crumbling around me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.19,0:01:37.57,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion na toki kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.20,0:01:40.37,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}nanigenai soshite sarigenai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.20,0:01:40.37,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Living my life as if everything was fine
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.37,0:01:42.74,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}kizu ga nai uchi ni ubawareteita
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.37,0:01:42.74,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Until suddenly it was stolen away without warning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.98,0:01:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.74,0:01:46.21,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}torikaeshi ni iku nara ima sa
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.74,0:01:46.21,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}This is my only chance to take it back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.21,0:01:50.54,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}tsuranuita ya no youna surudosa de
