Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.83,0:02:28.12,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 26: {\fs80} Rock Paper Scissors Kid is Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.83,0:02:28.12,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 26: {\fs80} Rock, Paper, Scissors Kid is Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't our manga\Nartist extraordinaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're having a good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.46,0:02:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, snapping a few photos, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.74,0:02:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to take candid shots of office\Nworkers while on their morning commute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira, he stole\Nsomeone's identity, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's probably commuting to work\Njust as his victim once did. You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's between 25 and 35\Nand nearly 2 meters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Add in that he's an office worker and\Nour suspect pool dramatically decreases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can you be sure he\Nuses this exact station?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could just as easily commute by car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, though he may have changed his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's very likely that he will\Nstill fall into old habits. Habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll arouse the suspicion\Nof his cover family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now, they must realize\Nsomething's amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My biggest fear is that the family\Nwill recognize their intruder,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prompting him to eliminate them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't you think for a\Nmoment that I'm going soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to find Kira\Nbefore he wreaks more havoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, tall bros!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does one of you want to play\Nme in a game of Rochambeau?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:03:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rocham!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you two deaf or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an oddball. Just play already!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.72,0:04:04.47,Main,Ken,0,0,0,,{\an8}Rock, Paper...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose every station has a\Nnut job or two running around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, if you come across any\Nleads, you know how to reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go sticking your nose in\Ntrouble all by yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you that manga artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stopped drawing for\Na little while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a big Shonen Jump\Nfan, so I know your work.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.24,0:04:33.58,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: Shonen Jump is the weekly manga magazine Diamond is Unbreakable was printed in.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.24,0:04:33.58,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: Shonen Jump is the weekly comics magazine Diamond is Unbreakable was printed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't kill you to\Nplay with me, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your problem, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit the bricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I just want to play\NRochambeau, it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boy's left cheek has a big hole in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so deep, I bet it\Nextends into his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No hard feelings if you win, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a drawing we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:05:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're late, then you lose,\Nunderstand? Ready? And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ro-sham!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.12,0:05:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid is being weirdly tenacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ro-sham!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's Door! Shut this brat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, now let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says his name is Ken Oyunagi, age 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing anything\Nabout him having a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got the injury when he\Nfell from a telephone pole.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.98,0:05:45.99,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Loves Rock Paper Scissors. \NWants to play real bad. Plays Scissors first.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.98,0:05:45.99,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Loves Rock, Paper, Scissors. \NWants to play real bad. Plays Scissors first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He feels compelled to play Rochambeau.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bizarre, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.15,0:05:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you two gentlemen going\Nto need a ride, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could we trouble you for 30 more seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:05:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we do this, you'll\Nhave to leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.16,0:06:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rooshambo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I've done\Nenough work for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.43,0:06:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you calling it quits for the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of sitting all by\Nyourself, why don't you join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A self-absorbed jerk-off,\Na moron, and a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three people I have absolutely\Nnothing in common with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm working at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet, but you never actually sat down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seat was free so I took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You snooze you lose, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:06:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's settle this with Rochambeau.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winner takes the seat, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.98,0:07:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sat here first so you can't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my senior, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei, why can't\Nyou give him a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, look at him, he's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be the mature one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could try sitting next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of you are helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll play with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what you're after, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's more like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ro-sham-bo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got nothing to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, for one, have never been so happy\Nto win a game of Rochambeau in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call this being mature?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no better feeling than\Ndestroying a smug whelp at his own game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lost again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is some good material.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew such an obscure\Nbook could be found in Mario?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm, 7,500 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I have that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.78,0:08:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I want to buy this book!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You obnoxious little...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's duke it out, Rochambeau-style!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rochambeau-rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're messing with\Nthe wrong artist, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that! I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still think I'm just a punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.24,0:08:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One win, two losses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that damn cheek hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I wasn't off base before!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might be a user! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is freaking awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have guessed it\Nwas hiding something so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.32,0:09:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never felt anything like the\Nenergy flowing into me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like being supercharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now quickly, heaven's door, turn\Nthis little brat into a book.
