Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.75,0:09:32.80,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: I cannot attack Kishibe Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from his sloppy work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that must have been the first\Ntime he's used his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, that doesn't mean he\Nwon't master it given time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to beat the crap out\Nof Rohan and Rochambeau, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rochambeau isn't a game of chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:09:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a psychological game of will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I beat Rohan at Rochambeau,\Nit means I've outwilled him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan's only 20 years old, but\Nhe lives life on his own terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His work also inspires\Na whole lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can beat the crap out\Nof Rohan in Rochambeau,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that'll prove I can be\Nbetter than him one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to grow up, because then I'll\Nbe just as respected as the great Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid is well on the road\Nto becoming a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arrow must have just\Npierced his soul ability
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,winning in Rochambeau makes\Nmy opponent's energy my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I must play five games\Nwinning two games only
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.34,0:10:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gives me partial energy\Nso he needs to win five.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.83,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: I cannot attack Kishibe Rohan.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.83,0:10:44.74,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: I ... attack Kishibe Rohan.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.54,0:10:47.04,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: I ... attack Kishibe Rohan.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.46,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: I can attack Kishibe Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be how did you so this powers\Ncalled a stand that's pretty awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thought you dodged a\Nbullet there, didn't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, think again, because I've already\Ngot a third of your so-called stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My right arm is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is, and one third of its\Nincredible power is under my control!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you can't poke\Naround in my head anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and if I win two more times,\Nall of your powers will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You punk, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking a swing at me like\Nthat was pretty ballsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you got a taste\Nof your own medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to defeat you in\Nanother game of Rochambeau.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only way I'll win\Nback my Stan's right arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Game on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
