Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you completely oblivious\Nto the plight you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.10,0:11:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you lose just one more\Ntime, you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely by now you've realized\Nyou're all out of chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I know you're a stand\Nuser, I'll show you no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment I retrieve my right arm,\NI'm putting you out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admit defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you trying to psych me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's get this started.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready to play just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won the last match using paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess it's only natural to want\Nto go with rock or scissors this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it'd be kind of stupid to go\Nwith the obvious just cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's pretty clear to anyone with eyes\Nyou're not the naive type, Rohan-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So maybe going with paper\Nwould be the best way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what could it hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I've made up my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ro-sham-fo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I outwilled Rohan-sensei\Nwith the power of paper!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.28,0:12:49.74,Episode 26 Typesetting 1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(175,0)\pos(189.6,873.2)}Ken
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.28,0:12:49.74,Episode 26 Typesetting 1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(175,0)\pos(1689.6,290)}Rohan
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.28,0:12:49.74,Episode 26 Typesetting 2 - Outline,Sign,0,0,0,,{\be(5)\fad(175,0)\pos(960,90.2)}5 Matches
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes two wins and two losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sucks for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just took the lower\Nhalf of your heavens door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're tired, you could\Nrest on that bench over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When vanquishing your opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must savor it and look down on\Nthe Concord with pity and disdain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got two wins and two losses, so\Nwe're both one game away from destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm so close to victory,\NI can almost taste it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I lost twice, but I came\Nback and won twice in a row!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the other way around for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've lost twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're smack dab in the middle\Nof a major losing streak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As expected from one chosen by\Nthe arrow, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this kid can finish absorbing\NRohan Kishibe's mind-reading powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll serve my precious Yoshikage well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotten better at the mind games.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive for a punk kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've lost the game twice\Nin a row. That's a fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're big on facts, I take it\Nyou won't mind if I tell you another.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive you won't be\Nusing paper for this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll find out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not get ahead of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went with Rock twice,\Nand it cost me both times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious now that Rock is\Nmy unlucky play. Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.26,0:14:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It goes without saying I'd be adverse to\Nusing Rock again when it's been so unkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since I won't be going with rock this\Ntime, you won't be able to use paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using it would be the same as\Nadmitting I'm not on a losing streak,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,despite what you said a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still gonna lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:14:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rope! Shamp! Rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that bluffing, and\Nhe still used paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What mental fortitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm gonna lose to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have the upper hand in this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use paper four times in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This game's in the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to go back to rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make misfortune work in my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with my knees?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.65,0:15:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's never moved like that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only move Rohan hasn't\Nused yet is scissors. Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going with paper four\Ntimes in a row is risky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems Rock wasn't unlucky after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister, can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Rohan-sensei, those two\Nare probably users too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm right, I can\Nfeel it in my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.16,0:16:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's test my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it all runs out, those two will\Nhead over here and rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if luck is on my side coming over here\Nwill be the last thing on their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at that It's Rohan again.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.33,0:16:20.50,Main,Ken,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really can't stand that guy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just smile at him and keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose we could do that
