Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah later, man
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems luck is still on\Nmy side, Rohan-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you scared yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never felt more\Nconfident about winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I've got luck, I can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I could play a high-stakes\Ngame of Russian Roulette with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:17:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,five out of six bullets in the chamber\Nand still live to tell the epic tale!
