Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a shower of glass is nothing to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, it's time for the final match.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's going to win, Mr. Rohan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and assume your Rochambeau pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who needs to\Nhurry up and get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can knock off the jokes, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you said your aim is to surpass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since I'm a bit older, I'll\Nlet you in on a little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beating one's opponent isn't all that\Ndifficult when you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's really challenging is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real challenge is\Ntruly outdoing oneself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.14,0:18:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is what I'm going\Nto do using my own luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.12,0:18:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I all of a sudden\Nmaking the rock move?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes three wins and two losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've got the unlucky rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it wasn't just Joseph Joestar\Nwho paid me a visit, luck did too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The invisible baby.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.02,0:18:51.40,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: I will save Rohan when he's in danger. \NI will become invisible and make the kid's hand into "Rock."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put too much energy\Ninto being given luck
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while I took it upon\Nmyself to make my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the very meaning\Nof outdoing oneself.
