Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, as I recall, I promise\Nto put you out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to write, as long as I\Nlive, I shall lose it, Rochambeau.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my stand shall be no more, fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me, Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, if you touch\Nme, the baby gets it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea\Nwhat it is you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've moved on now to a war of words!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.34,0:19:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't really beat me in that match!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a\Nlow-down cheat and a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battle me one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do that and the baby stays safe and sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.69,0:19:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surrender the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll humor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, boom, boom, boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.75,0:20:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went through all that trouble to\Ngive you stand powers and you blew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sayonara!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm simply going to wipe\Nyour stand out of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to live life under the\Nshadow of your stupid writing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be worse than death!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.32,0:20:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you play\Naround in my head, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather jump in front\Nof this giant truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live with that, Rohan!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.87,0:20:42.88,SFXGreen,7,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\frz349.6\pos(1514.6,668.4)\c&H090B0C&}Pfft
