Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bravo, kid, I was wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People who have a flair for\Nthe dramatic comic book-like
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,action I didn't really know how\Nto bullet the old heartstrings.
