Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're gonna get run\Nover too! I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did this\Ndamn wind come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My view is blown!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It went around us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have been killed, too,\Nif it hadn't swerved, but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it... luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, but I must say you've\Nbecome quite an interesting person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you must never\Nuse your stand for evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just my luck that I\Nwould hit that truck down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.66,0:21:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've completely lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan, wait up! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:21:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you haven't seen the\Nbaby anywhere, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the kid has suddenly gone missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if she's turned\Nfully invisible again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just pretend like nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, where'd you go? Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.76,0:22:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosham Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.04,0:22:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real name, Oyanagi Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stan's name, Boy II Man,\Nnot out of commission,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.66,0:22:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though the hole in his cheek remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any time I need to see your\Nface, it has closed my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.93,0:22:52.30,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.30,0:22:54.56,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.50,0:22:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am taking two parts\Nwith a crystal mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.56,0:22:57.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.74,0:22:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And magenta feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a shelter in the face of my spine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.35,0:22:59.02,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:22:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight like a chicken cherry cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to try to explain.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.02,0:23:01.40,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hold on tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.40,0:23:03.77,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.58,0:23:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again,\NI'ma move so slightly.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.77,0:23:06.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.52,0:23:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the human kind of all that I need to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.57,0:23:08.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.28,0:23:10.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.41,0:23:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.53,0:23:12.87,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.60,0:23:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what hit you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.87,0:23:14.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.49,0:23:17.12,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.74,0:23:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.12,0:23:21.62,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I need you.
